  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8467291c7137455",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客文章中，我们将分享发布 CinePile 2.0 的历程。这是我们长视频问答数据集的一个显著改进版本。新数据集的改进依赖于一种新方法，我们将其命名为对抗式数据集精炼。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f36c540bf265cea",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴分享 CinePile 2.0 以及我们的对抗式精炼方法实现。我们相信，这种方法可以增强许多现有数据集，并直接成为未来数据集构建流程的一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a3fbed9f7bfc7f4",
      "translationZh": "如果你主要对对抗式精炼方法感兴趣，可以直接跳转到“对抗式精炼”部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "54a47fcf6d128633",
      "translationZh": "等等，CinePile 是什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49feb0f3236b1472",
      "translationZh": "2024 年 5 月，我们推出了 CinePile，这是一个长视频问答数据集，包含约 300,000 个训练样本和 5,000 个测试样本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cbf575fb38a5c735",
      "translationZh": "首个版本在两个方面有别于其他数据集：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "855458cf0fa090c5",
      "translationZh": "问题多样性：涵盖时序理解、情节分析、角色关系动态、故事背景和主题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "86c42c9658686a71",
      "translationZh": "问题难度：在我们的基准测试中，人类的表现比最好的商用视觉模型高出 25%，比开源视觉模型高出 65%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8f85fd21d9d444dd",
      "translationZh": "查看一个数据样本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8c42159ae4bb287",
      "translationZh": "其背后的秘诀之一，是使用 YouTube 上的电影片段，以及从专为视障观众制作的精准口述影像中提炼出的问答。这些描述提供了超越基本视觉信息（例如“这辆车是什么颜色的？”）的丰富上下文，帮助我们创建更复杂的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d03bfb15ef562361",
      "translationZh": "再多讲讲。你们是如何构建原始数据集的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e922668d382ed6c",
      "translationZh": "为了自动生成问题，我们首先研究了 MovieQA 和 TVQA 等现有数据集，构建出问题模板。我们使用文本相似度模型 WhereIsAI/UAE-Large-V1 对这些数据集中的问题进行聚类，然后从每个簇中随机选取 10 个示例作为提示，让 GPT-4 为每个簇生成一个问题模板和一个典型问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "292c06f0045a45d0",
      "translationZh": "类别",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "65b4746e9a87748d",
      "translationZh": "问题模板",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "881ed4de5463d56f",
      "translationZh": "典型问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3671a5ef3391ac3e",
      "translationZh": "角色与关系动态（CRD）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7bd4ff26a562e534",
      "translationZh": "人际关系动态",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f993a7f3b227b942",
      "translationZh": "在共同经历或行动之后，人物 A 与人物 B 之间的关系发生了哪些变化？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3671a5ef3391ac3e",
      "translationZh": "角色与关系动态（CRD）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de9def1f60c3e290",
      "translationZh": "决策理由",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35206e44d5447f19",
      "translationZh": "角色为自己作出的决定给出了哪些理由？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2950df9ecf56a83",
      "translationZh": "叙事与情节分析（NPA）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "42ca858acd391a8d",
      "translationZh": "危机事件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d06e62a605ef0e6c",
      "translationZh": "什么重大事件导致角色采取了极端行动？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2950df9ecf56a83",
      "translationZh": "叙事与情节分析（NPA）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49e46a3b766c4032",
      "translationZh": "谜团揭晓",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ee9bd48ee9a90d0",
      "translationZh": "角色 A 揭露了关于事件 B 的什么秘密？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33f9280b6afced40",
      "translationZh": "场景与技术分析（STA）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "461c85aaa2e18f23",
      "translationZh": "随身物品",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33dd51868f60c23f",
      "translationZh": "[Character Name] 手里拿着什么？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33f9280b6afced40",
      "translationZh": "场景与技术分析（STA）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a933f7262ab074d8",
      "translationZh": "环境细节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7348b1e5d2f63779",
      "translationZh": "[场景/地点]在[特定时间/地点/事件][期间/时]是什么样子的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "038406a7a231034b",
      "translationZh": "时间维度（TEMP）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "30c1cc01570ce0a4",
      "translationZh": "时间敏感的关键行动",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8293b27bb9c550e",
      "translationZh": "[角色]必须迅速做什么，否则会有什么后果？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8948ac582be8bf60",
      "translationZh": "时间维度（Temp）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16b6668d9831a1b8",
      "translationZh": "频次",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ed20c58e608d62b1",
      "translationZh": "一个角色尝试[行动 A]多少次？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a873325e3f6a82b",
      "translationZh": "主题探索（TH）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1405fe5bf11e4936",
      "translationZh": "象征与母题追踪",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e986c2e129ac0cd",
      "translationZh": "场景 A 中引入的象征或母题，是否在场景 B 中再次出现或有所演变？它们有何寓意？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a873325e3f6a82b",
      "translationZh": "主题探索（TH）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73b5c8e7428b8551",
      "translationZh": "主题上的呼应",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32083df1da467289",
      "translationZh": "从电影主题的角度来看，该场景中的混乱与什么形成呼应？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b25d557ded78de55",
      "translationZh": "由于模板并不总是适用于每一个电影片段，我们使用 Gemini 1.0 Pro 为每个场景选择最合适的模板。接下来，我们将场景文本、选定的模板名称（例如“实体持有”）、示例问题和一条系统提示输入语言模型，以生成针对该场景的问题。精心设计的提示有助于模型关注整个场景，在生成更深入问题的同时避免肤浅的问题。我们发现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d6ae8c3fc69dfe01",
      "translationZh": "提供典型示例，并为对话和视觉描述添加时间戳，可以防止 GPT-4 产生幻觉",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38ed933f923e5109",
      "translationZh": "这种方法能够生成更具迷惑性的多项选择题（MCQ）干扰选项",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8aa5e16d8d2fdf2",
      "translationZh": "要求模型为其答案提供理由，可以提高问题的质量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b9780afb9a10d789",
      "translationZh": "采用这种方法，我们为每个视频生成约 32 个问题。在发布 CinePile 之前，我们实施了多种机制，以确保数据集/基准的质量；下一节将介绍这些机制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8c56e70eae7a2702",
      "translationZh": "检查初步结果的质量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "14910ee57bb6ed6b",
      "translationZh": "虽然我们的流程通常能生成表述规范且可以回答的问题，但有些问题过于简单，或仅涉及无需观看片段就能理解的基本概念。为此，我们使用了多个大语言模型（LLM）来识别并筛除以下三类问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07aaf479c2044e6f",
      "translationZh": "退化问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da0521c7ee8baac0",
      "translationZh": "如果一个问题的答案从问题本身就显而易见，则该问题被视为“退化”问题（例如，“粉红色房子是什么颜色的？”）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ed36b0eeaa3ed508",
      "translationZh": "这类问题在我们的数据集中仅占很小一部分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8143a9ee91fb622d",
      "translationZh": "由于以我们的规模无法进行人工审核，我们采用了三个 LLM——Gemini、GPT-3.5 和 Phi-1.5——进行自动检测",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e0507c7f216aa44f",
      "translationZh": "如果三个模型在没有任何上下文的情况下都能正确回答某个问题，该问题就会被排除在评估集之外。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24b6273bbfd33a79",
      "translationZh": "视觉依赖问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "83794eb792e2630c",
      "translationZh": "有些选择题仅凭对话就能作答，无需视觉信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f37b36da0fba2a65",
      "translationZh": "我们使用 Gemini 模型来判断问题是否仅凭对话就能作答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "127e0627a44fd185",
      "translationZh": "问题采用二元评分：无需视觉信息即可作答的记为 0，需要视觉信息的记为 1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b568904db32f667f",
      "translationZh": "难度评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8501ffc623779c77",
      "translationZh": "为了评估问题的难度，我们测试了模型即使获得完整上下文（包括视觉描述和字幕）是否仍能正确作答。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84fb07bc1a656c00",
      "translationZh": "通过我们团队和更广泛的社区持续使用这一基准，我们发现了几个有待改进的方面，这促使我们考虑 CinePile 2.0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77406e93b78d359b",
      "translationZh": "在 CinePile 的第二个版本中，我们与 Hugging Face 合作，确定了若干需要改进的方面，并排定了优先级。此前，他们已成功尝试在 CinePile 上对 Video Llava 7B 进行微调。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b8dd9e0cd658ab8f",
      "translationZh": "CinePile 1.0 中的问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1552563b78a3eef8",
      "translationZh": "虽然退化问题过滤在 CinePile 1.0 中发挥了作用，但它也存在若干局限：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1d80059fb4fe0327",
      "translationZh": "有些问题仅凭问答对就能作答，无需转录文本或视觉内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cdeb89bea011370c",
      "translationZh": "许多被标记的问题包含来自视频的有价值信息——与其丢弃这些问题，不如重新措辞，以更好地体现其价值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9bb844bb9c241c2d",
      "translationZh": "退化检查仅限于测试集：对于 CinePile 1.0 的训练集，大规模运行多个模型——尤其是专有模型——成本过高",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "36cd6a1d65c2bf56",
      "translationZh": "为了解决这些问题，我们引入了一条新的对抗式改进流程，帮助改进质量欠佳的问题，而不是简单地将其丢弃。这种方法更容易大规模应用。在本文中，我们将仅使用问题和答案选项、不使用视觉或对话信息来识别退化问题的模型统称为“聋盲大语言模型”（Deaf-Blind LLM）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b06d684e740ceaa6",
      "translationZh": "对抗式优化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b870fc26cd9faf1",
      "translationZh": "对抗式优化流程旨在修改问题或答案，直到盲聋大语言模型无法轻易预测出正确答案。其工作方式如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "57ea8b5909872e29",
      "translationZh": "盲聋大语言模型仅根据问题，给出答案以及解释其选择的理由",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a3d5beb15d08508a",
      "translationZh": "这些理由有助于识别问题中隐含的提示或偏见",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "387c2d1490d28015",
      "translationZh": "我们的问题生成模型利用这一理由来修改问题和/或答案选项，消除隐含线索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bab438be4c083b25",
      "translationZh": "每个问题最多重复这一过程五次，直到盲聋大语言模型的表现降至随机猜测水平",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "033c95e0baee28db",
      "translationZh": "考虑到这一迭代过程的计算需求，我们需要一个既强大又易于获取、且能够在本地运行的大语言模型，以避免 API 使用限制、延迟和云服务费用。我们选择了：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9153071c273d15b7",
      "translationZh": "LLaMA 3.1 70B（开源模型）作为盲聋大语言模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2152ae7539c8c3a1",
      "translationZh": "使用 GPT-4 生成问题修改版本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b111a57a9003275d",
      "translationZh": "为考虑随机猜中的可能性，我们：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "77eb8132e46cdb11",
      "translationZh": "测试了答案选项顺序的全部五种排列",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9d1fc027c69c7161",
      "translationZh": "如果模型在五次尝试中有三次回答正确，就将该问题标记为退化问题",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b67fb327f60a9d59",
      "translationZh": "对抗性优化的结果",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "267a85176c62d280",
      "translationZh": "简而言之，在 CinePile 中进行对抗性优化带来了以下效果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c6a675d21b421d53",
      "translationZh": "成功修改了测试集中 90.24% 的退化问答对",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "028c923cafa8c7cb",
      "translationZh": "人工审查了无法修复的问答对（800 对中约有 80 对）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6b7aa8922bda3c1e",
      "translationZh": "尽可能进行修改",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9fb1207797d60508",
      "translationZh": "否则从评估子集中排除",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df358105006bc7c5",
      "translationZh": "修正了训练集中 90.94% 的薄弱配对",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9677c69cd3005d42",
      "translationZh": "保留无法修复的配对，因为它们不会对性能产生负面影响",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1cff7713912f5d53",
      "translationZh": "实现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d37e4aee1b07c199",
      "translationZh": "在本次发布中，我们公开了对抗式改进流水线以及用于识别薄弱问题的代码。完整实现（包括所有提示词）可在我们的公开代码仓库中获取。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b25cc6989b4f2bc5",
      "translationZh": "评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b75a2b1da3389e43",
      "translationZh": "在修改后的测试集上测试了此前评估过的模型和 16 个新的 Video-LLMs 后，我们在下图中重点展示了表现最佳的模型。结果如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d3484ab14d378a4",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 1.5 Pro 在商业视觉语言模型（VLMs）中处于领先地位",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7f920a86687085db",
      "translationZh": "在“场景与技术分析”方面尤其出色",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "29d1dc2d7321018c",
      "translationZh": "在以视觉信息为主导、涉及电影环境和角色互动的问题上表现最佳",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af11ce63ed378f60",
      "translationZh": "基于 GPT 的模型展现出有竞争力的表现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "30cbc6c7fefe5527",
      "translationZh": "擅长“叙事与情节分析”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8155e2749aef4fac",
      "translationZh": "在涉及故事情节和角色互动的问题上表现良好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98606524d9afdc28",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 1.5 Flash 是 Gemini 1.5 Pro 的轻量版本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6077f183ce5b13e0",
      "translationZh": "总体准确率达到 58.75%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "817745ab5eddef43",
      "translationZh": "在“场景与技术分析”方面表现尤为出色",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "786327e392a3ae3c",
      "translationZh": "开源模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fd4a8da88882a93a",
      "translationZh": "从 CinePile 的首个版本到当前版本，开源视频大语言模型社区取得了显著进展。以下是我们的发现：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d81033134a6c3a93",
      "translationZh": "LLaVa-One Vision 领跑开源模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8f5bad9e8a78e9f",
      "translationZh": "准确率达到 49.34%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "974a754a9a90c6b8",
      "translationZh": "相比 CinePile 1.0 中表现最好的模型（准确率为 22.51% 的 Video LLaVA），有了大幅提升",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9670db66c3c92d83",
      "translationZh": "较小的模型展现出了有竞争力的表现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "adfca7f09b30c6a2",
      "translationZh": "LLaVa-OV（7B 参数）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42fd3cbf1d19d3de",
      "translationZh": "MiniCPM-V 2.6（8B 参数）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
