    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c240c89fa6018d1f",
      "translationZh": "仍有改进空间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c42e630f50938d1",
      "translationZh": "几乎所有模型在高难度划分上的准确率都下降了 15-20%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c790584fb4c3402",
      "translationZh": "这表明仍有很大的改进空间",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0118",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b5dcf94bffbb593",
      "translationZh": "高难度划分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ff492bb009f6c57",
      "translationZh": "CinePile 的高难度划分结果清楚地表明，当前模型在理解视觉叙事和故事要素方面仍远远落后于人类。这一差距凸显了 CinePile 新版本作为基准的价值，可用于衡量模型在迈向更复杂的视觉理解能力方面取得的进展。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "31b4712158726342",
      "translationZh": "排行榜",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "307dabb7ef492637",
      "translationZh": "我们推出了新的 CinePile 排行榜，并将随着新模型的出现持续更新。请访问该空间，了解如何提交你自己的模型进行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
